Yes, you're correct - although I installed the development version as you suggested, RStudio was still referencing the previous install for some reason. I quit RStudio and reloaded it and everything is working. I apologize for not thinking to evoke the age old 'turn it off then turn it on again' solution myself:-)

Finally, thanks so much for your help over the past few days, I realise you must be very busy and are under no obligation at all to spend time on this sort of thing. I really appreciate it. Should we ever meet I will buy you beer (or whatever else might appeal).

Have a good weekend - and thanks again.

Andy

